# Chapter 1: Opening the Black Box

Let's start off with the genesis of it all-the transformer. All LLMs (Large-Language Models) run off of an incredible innovation
called the transformer. Now the transformer we are talking about is not the one that causes power cuts when it blows
up in a storm. Instead we are talking about the one proposed in, certainly one of the research papers of the century, **Attention
is All you Need". If you get the chance and have some math background I will highly recommend reading this paper. And for anyone 
who wants to enter this field I will say its required reading. 

Now we've mentioned transformer this and transformer that but what in the world is a transformer? 
